    "detailed_description": "Embark on an exhilarating journey to ascend to the peak of an ever-changing world in &quot;Dash or Die.&quot; Armed with unique abilities like double jump and dash, your quest is anything but ordinary. Navigate through an array of richly detailed environments, each offering distinct challenges and gameplay mechanics.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nKey Features:<br />\r\nDouble Jump &amp; Dash: Master the art of movement with your special double-jump and dash abilities.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDynamic Environments: Traverse through rich verious environements changin through your ascend.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHigh-Stakes Gameplay: The higher you climb, the harder the fall. One misstep could send you tumbling down, forcing you to start your ascent all over again.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUnlockable Skills and Power-Ups: Enhance your journey with new abilities and power-ups, each designed to help you overcome the increasingly complex challenges that lie ahead.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhat to Expect:<br />\r\nAn adrenaline-fueled adventure that will challenge both your reflexes and wits.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nA game world that is as beautiful as it is treacherous, filled with hidden secrets and challenges.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nA risk-and-reward system that will keep you at the edge of your seat, compelling you to reach new heights or face the consequences.",
    "about_the_game": "Embark on an exhilarating journey to ascend to the peak of an ever-changing world in &quot;Dash or Die.&quot; Armed with unique abilities like double jump and dash, your quest is anything but ordinary. Navigate through an array of richly detailed environments, each offering distinct challenges and gameplay mechanics.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nKey Features:<br />\r\nDouble Jump &amp; Dash: Master the art of movement with your special double-jump and dash abilities.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDynamic Environments: Traverse through rich verious environements changin through your ascend.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHigh-Stakes Gameplay: The higher you climb, the harder the fall. One misstep could send you tumbling down, forcing you to start your ascent all over again.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUnlockable Skills and Power-Ups: Enhance your journey with new abilities and power-ups, each designed to help you overcome the increasingly complex challenges that lie ahead.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhat to Expect:<br />\r\nAn adrenaline-fueled adventure that will challenge both your reflexes and wits.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nA game world that is as beautiful as it is treacherous, filled with hidden secrets and challenges.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nA risk-and-reward system that will keep you at the edge of your seat, compelling you to reach new heights or face the consequences.",
